{{! allcrud-generator: brand-new template, NOT an override of an embedded openapi-generator
    file - the stock "spring" generator has no unit-test template at all. Registered as a
    per-tag "api template file" via CodegenConfig#apiTemplateFiles() in the generation driver
    code (see AllcrudGenerator), with output suffix "ServiceTest.java".

    Extends the core's CrudServiceTests base (com.techmath.allcrud.service, confirmed via
    javap against the allcrud test-fixtures jar, not guessed) - a Mockito-only test, no Spring
    context: the base only needs entityClass/idClass in its constructor and two abstract
    accessors (getRepository/getService) to drive its own suite of @Test methods. The base
    class itself carries no class-level annotations (also confirmed via javap), so
    @ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class) has to be declared here, not inherited.

    allcrudEntityName / allcrudIdType / allcrudEntityPackage / allcrudRepositoryPackage /
    allcrudServicePackage are resolved per-resource by AllcrudSpringCodegen - see that class.
    UNIT_TEST has no allcrudUnitTestPackage of its own to resolve for cross-file imports:
    nothing else ever imports "the unit test" class, unlike Service/Repository which this
    template itself imports. This is a per-resource artifact placed under
    GenerationRequest#testSourceRoot (never sourceRoot), always "generate once, never
    overwrite" - no onRegenerate knob, same as Service/Repository/Converter/Controller. }}
